    "captured_text": "40K.APP\nFACTIONS\nAELDARI\nEldrad Ulthran\nDATASHEET\nUPDATES\nMODELS\nM\nT\nSV\nW\nLD\nOC\nEldrad Ulthran 32mm\n\nInvulnerable save: 4+\n\n7\"\n4\n6+\n5\n6+\n1\nRANGED WEAPONS\nRNG\nA\nBS\nS\nAP\nD\nMind War\nANTI-CHARACTER 4+\nPRECISION\nPSYCHIC\n18\"\n1\n2+\n5\n-2\nD6\nShuriken pistol\nASSAULT\nPISTOL\n12\"\n1\n2+\n4\n-1\n1\nMELEE WEAPONS\nA\nWS\nS\nAP\nD\nThe Staff of Ulthamar and witchblade\nANTI-INFANTRY 2+\nPSYCHIC\n3\n2+\n5\n-1\n2\nKEYWORDS\nAELDARI\nCHARACTER\nELDRAD ULTHRAN\nEPIC HERO\nFARSEER\nINFANTRY\nPSYKER\nCOSTS\n1 model\n120 pts\nUNIT COMPOSITION\n1 Eldrad Ulthran \u2013 EPIC HERO\n\nThis model is equipped with: Mind War; shuriken pistol; Staff of Ulthamar and witchblade.\n\nLeads\nSTORM GUARDIANS\nGUARDIAN DEFENDERS\nCORE ABILITIES\nLEADER\nFACTION ABILITIES\nBATTLE FOCUS\nUNIT ABILITIES\nDiviner of Futures\n\nAt the start of your Command phase, if this model is on the battlefield, you gain 1CP.\n\nDoom\n\nAt the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a friendly AELDARI model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.\n\nSTATS\n25%\nof Aeldari lists\n#10\nmost-taken in faction\n28%\nfrom 24% since last update\nIN ARMY LISTS\nPopular detachments\nARMOURED WARHOST\nSEER COUNCIL\nSPIRIT CONCLAVE\nMost often leads\nSTORM GUARDIANS\nGUARDIAN DEFENDERS\nWARLOCK CONCLAVE\nOften taken with\nWAR WALKERS\nWRAITHLORD\nFARSEER\nGUARDIAN DEFENDERS\nWARLOCK CONCLAVE",
